# GraphMeter

## Import

```svelte
import { GraphMeter } from 'markgraphy';
```

## Basic usage

```svelte
<GraphMeter
  title="example"
  value={0}
  ticks={14}
/>
```

<div class="live">
<GraphMeter
  title="example"
  value={0}
  ticks={14}
/>
</div>

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `value` | `number` | `—` | — |
| `ticks?` | `number` | `14` | — |
| `caption?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `glyphs?` | `Glyphs` | `—` | — |
| `palette?` | `GraphPalette` | `—` | — |
| `corner?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `class?` | `string` | `''` | — |

## Exported types

- `GraphMeterProps`
